    "description": "Nagase & Co., Ltd. manufactures, imports/exports, and sells chemicals, plastics, electronic materials, cosmetics, and health foods worldwide. It offers resin raw materials, monomers, resins, solvents, pigments, dyes, dispersing materials, additives, urethane raw materials, flame retardants, release agents, conductive materials, functional sheets, films, adhesives, and sanitary materials. The company also provides petrochemical products, metal processing oil, surfactants and related raw materials, environmental equipment and chemicals, electronic chemicals, UV-curing agent materials, and chemical outsourcing coordination services. In addition, it offers engineering, general-purpose, packaging, and other plastic-related products and services; precision abrasive materials, optical materials, touch-panel components, functional paints, conductive and insulating materials, adhesive and sealing materials, heat-resistant films, optical lenses, chemical management devices, low dielectric materials, LED lighting, sensing devices, IoT modules, optical materials for XR, and semiconductor- and electronic device-related equipment. Further, the company provides modified epoxy resins and related products, photolithography materials for flat panel displays and semiconductors, and materials related to 3D printing; mobility interior and exterior functional parts, including various resins, functional paints, adhesives, lightweight parts, decorative parts, and HMI parts; xEV-related parts, thermal control parts, battery materials, sensors, LiDAR-related parts, and autonomous driving technologies. Additionally, it offers pharmaceuticals, in vitro diagnostics, raw materials for cosmetics and household products, food materials, premixes, agricultural, fisheries, and livestock-related materials, and endotoxin removal services. The company was founded in 1832 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
